 "body": "1. In menu Sketch / Include Library: library types (Arduino|Recommended|Contributed\u2026) are not translated into selected \u00abEditor language\u00bb although the types are translated in .po files. Variable `lastLibType` was not wrapped by `tr()` function.\r\n2. In Preferences dialogue, Editor language drop-down list: incorrect grammatical gender for Ukrainian in Ukrainian (\u0423\u043a\u0440\u0430\u0457\u043d\u0441\u044c\u043a*\u0438\u0439* but must be \u0423\u043a\u0440\u0430\u0457\u043d\u0441\u044c\u043a*\u0430*, see [Ukrainian language](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ukrainian_language) preamble).",
